description.narrative:
Within this project the following goals are pursued:

- produce the basic knowledge for the better understanding of the functioning of the hydrology and hydrogeology of the area; 
- develop tailored training modules on agro-hydrology, improved irrigation and agricultural practices;
- set up of a training program: including presentations and exercises in a workshop setting;
- contribute to capacity building of local agricultural extension officers and make them water ambassadors;
- support Meki Batu Union in their effort to make their members wisely use the available water resources in the area.
